@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Component rename - preserve installation data
actor Administrator
participant "Moodle upgrade" as Upgrade
participant "local_multipicker install" as Local
participant "repository_multipicker install" as Repository
database "Plugin / core metadata" as DB
Administrator -> Upgrade : Install both new component packages
Upgrade -> DB : Create new local tables with XMLDB
Upgrade -> Local : Run post-install hook
Local -> DB : Check old tables and empty new tables
Local -> DB : Import IDs, history, rules and grants
Local -> DB : Transfer settings / role overrides / adhoc tasks
Local -> DB : Reset sequences; retire old version registration
Upgrade -> Repository : Run post-install hook
Repository -> DB : Rename type; retain instance and reference IDs
Upgrade -> DB : Clear caches
Administrator -> Upgrade : Refresh catalog; reopen native forms
@enduml
